      Francisco & Serena 義大利 17 天終極隨行手札
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-xs border-t border-stone-700 pt-4 text-stone-300">
      <div><span class="text-stone-400 block">日期</span>10/09 - 10/26</div>
