  <!-- ==================== 行李清單 ==================== -->
  <h2 class="text-stone-800 font-black text-2xl mb-4 text-center serif-title tracking-widest mt-8">— 🧳 完整行李檢核表 (10月氣候適用) —</h2>
  <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-3xl p-5 mb-8 card-avoid-break">
    <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-4">義大利10月秋季日夜溫差大，北部10-18°C，中南部15-24°C。此清單為 17 天行程（帶 8 天份替換）之最佳配置：</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- 衣物 -->
      <table class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <thead class="bg-stone-200 text-stone-700"><tr><th class="p-2 w-10 text-center">✓</th><th class="p-2">👕 衣物與配件</th><th class="p-2 text-center w-16">數量</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-100 border border-stone-200">
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">短袖 T-shirt / 內搭 (南部白天穿)</td><td class="p-2 text-center">4件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">薄長袖 / SATUR 質感襯衫</td><td class="p-2 text-center">4-5件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">中厚度毛衣 / 大學T (防風保暖)</td><td class="p-2 text-center">2件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">防風防潑水薄外套 (輕便收納)</td><td class="p-2 text-center">1件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">保暖防寒外套 / 經典風衣</td><td class="p-2 text-center">1件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">休閒長褲 / 牛仔褲 (避開厚發熱褲)</td><td class="p-2 text-center">4件</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 text-center"><span class="print-checkbox"></span></td><td class="p-2">貼身內衣褲 / 吸汗襪子</td><td class="p-2 text-center">各8-10</td></tr>
